    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kay tupachiy huk chininipi ruwan chaymanta kay dispositivoyki watiqmanta qallarin. Kay dispositivoyki mana ruwayta kankichu yastakamaña.
  \resources\EnterProductKey_UpgradeInstructions1Text:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Edicioniyki kunanchachkan musuq caracteristicakuna Windows kaqman yapay. Ñawpaq qallarinki, chiqaqchay llamakayniykita waqaychaypaq chaymanta wakin llamkanakuna wichqay.
  \resources\EnterProductKey_UpgradeGvlkWarningText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Kausachiypaq kay ruruman haykunawan chanta Windows hinariyniyuq kawsarichichkan, kay dispositivota hatun llamkaypa kawsarichiynin yanapakuyniykiman tinkiyta munan.
  \resources\EnterProductKey_UpgradeErrorText:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Mana Windows hinariyniyuqmanta tupachiyta atikuykuchu. Watiqmanta Windows hinariyniyuqmanta kawsarichichkan. (0x%08x)
  \resources\EnterProductKey_UpgradeErrorHeaderText:
