  \resources\EnterProductKey_Error_NoInternet:
    Candidate Language=QUZ-PE: Windows manam kawsarichiyta atikuykuchu imarayku kawsachiypa qarakuqkunayku mana kunanpuni hapirinalla kankuchu. Chiqaqchay Internetman tinkisqanki chaymanta kikillan Windows kaqman kausachiyta ruwayku mayk'aq kay yanapakuyta hapirinalla hamun. (0x%08x)
  \resources\EnterProductKey_Error_NoFreeUpgrade:
